      <marc:subfield code="a">Yuuta Hibiki wakes up in the room of Rikka Takarada and notices two things: he has no memories, and he can hear a mysterious voice calling his name from a nearby room. On further inspection, he finds a robot which introduces itself as Hyper Agent Gridman behind the screen of an old computer. Much to Yuuta&apos;s surprise, Rikka cannot hear Gridman, nor can she see the ominous monsters looming over a thick fog as it envelopes the town outside</marc:subfield>
